  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Sudan 2024 &#x2013; UNICEF WASH Cluster Engineer</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is an assignment at the request of UNICEF. Sudan is going through multiple crisis along with displacement, there is a looming threat of famine, the approaching rain and flood season, as well as the cholera outbreak which started last year continues. The cluster partners are looking for more innovative and quick win designs in this dire emergency. The designs and bills of quantity which exists have not been reviewed for the last five to six years. The cost of the installation and construction has been outdated. The unavailability of supplies on the ground will need more focus on the locally available solutions which can still meet the standards as well as help curb the disease outbreaks. The WASH cluster engineer will help the WASH cluster to review their existing designs and come up with suitable recommendations and guide to be used by the partners.</narrative>
  </description>
